                                                "sense_id": "11ff92fc-e0c7-3834-8dd2-16d334f0ab42",
                                                "text": "The night was wild, the atabal / Scarce echoed on the rampart wall."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb4897b7-ed03-4b47-924e-8f400cf7b4f9",
